<p><b class="k">6.1. &ldquo;As-Is&rdquo; Service &amp; Zero Monetary Liability:</b> All academic resources and attendance calculators are provided on an &ldquo;AS IS&rdquo; and &ldquo;AS AVAILABLE&rdquo; basis without warranties of any kind. Because the Platform is a free, non-profit student initiative, the maximum aggregate liability of the Platform administrators for any claim under the Indian Contract Act, 1872 shall be INR 0 (Zero Rupees).</p>
